comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-12T11:33:13.673Z",codex-sol,"npm audit reports four high entries from one underlying braces stack-exhaustion advisory: braces, micromatch, fast-glob and pm-ops. npm audit --omit=dev reports zero vulnerabilities. The suggested automated fix would downgrade pm-ops to an older version and is not a safe automatic repair for this new package. No forced downgrade or upstream edit was made."
  "2026-10-15T06:55:23.301Z",codex-agent,"After removing unused direct fast-glob and pinning published pm-ops 2026.10.14: npm ls braces fast-glob micromatch is empty in full and production-only trees; npm audit --include=dev reports 0 high, 0 critical, 0 total vulnerabilities. No source functions changed; no behavioral revert proof applies. Release gates will verify compatibility at unchanged thresholds."
